</span><span begin="0:25.454" end="0:25.619">的</span><span begin="0:25.619" end="0:26.082">灯有</span><span begin="0:26.082" end="0:26.938">一半熟悉</span><span begin="0:26.938" end="0:27.278">一半</span><span begin="0:27.278" end="0:28.305">生</span></p><p begin="0:28.603" end="0:31.050" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:28.603" end="0:29.490">酒精让我</span><span begin="0:29.490" end="0:29.648">一</span><span begin="0:29.680" end="0:29.978">半</span><span begin="0:29.978" end="0:30.367">温热</span><span begin="0:30.367" end="0:31.050">一半冷</span></p><p begin="0:31.050" end="0:34.910" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.050" end="0:31.421">可你</span><span begin="0:31.421" end="0:32.512">扮演着成熟</span> <span begin="0:32.512" end="0:33.096">我一半</span><span begin="0:33.096" end="0:33.821">没感觉</span><span begin="0:33.821" end="0:34.208">一半</span><span begin="0:34.208" end="0:34.910">疼</span></p><p begin="0:35.321" end="0:38.219" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:35.321" end="0:36.417">就最后变成</span><span begin="0:36.417" end="0:36.745">一半</span><span begin="0:36.745" end="0:37.052">猜</span><span begin="0:37.052" end="0:37.259">忌</span><span begin="0:37.259" end="0:37.655">一半</span><span begin="0:37.655" end="0:38.219">问</span></p><p begin="0:38.477" end="0:42.099" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:38.477" end="0:39.801">我可能是自己</span><span begin="0:39.801" end="0:39.970">一</span><span begin="0:39.970" end="0:40.742">半爱你</span><span begin="0:40.742" end="0:40.920">一</span><span begin="0:40.920" end="0:41.163">半</span><span begin="0:41.163" end="0:42.099">恨</span></p><p begin="0:42.099" end="0:44.504" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:42.099" end="0:43.626">这离别是我灵感</span><span begin="0:43.626" end="0:43.797">的</span><span begin="0:43.797" end="0:44.256">秤</span><span begin="0:44.256" end="0:44.504">砣</span></p><p begin="0:44.531" end="0:48.972" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:44.531" end="0:44.691">我</span><span begin="